To use this function, you would need to register the `UserController` and the `show` method as a route in your `routes/web.php` file:

```php
Route::get('/users/{id}', 'UserController@show');
```

With this setup, you can access the user by visiting `/users/{id}` in your web browser, replacing `{id}` with the actual user ID you're interested in.

